      "",
      "3.(a) Show, using division, that 3⁰ = 1. (b) Copy and complete: 2⁴ = 16, 2³ = ____, 2² = ____, 2¹ = ____, 2⁰ = ____, and state the pattern that connects each line to the one above it. (c) Find the value of 2⁴ × 5⁰ × 3². **[A]**",
