      "> Perimeter = 2,400 + 1,750 + 2,400 + 1,750 = 8,300 m",
      ">",
      "> Convert back: 8,300 ÷ 1,000 = **8.3 km**",
      "",
      "> **Worked example 2 — converting to the larger unit**",
